      "description": "Product Attributes - Adobe SFCC - Confluence\nWhen looking at Magento sample data - map Magento Product Attributes against out of the box SFCC Product attributes - identify gaps - document in above confluence page.\nGoal: \nIdentify product attributes that are used in Magento\nIdentify gaps - which custom Product attributes are likely needed in SFCC\nProvide input for \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-26\n to be picked up for build",
